  "question": {
    "text": "If the inequality <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is satisfied for all <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the sum of all the integral values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> must be equal to",
