  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/db91fa35-deb1-4bb4-b67a-c10cfcd3c911.png\" style=\"width:1.74653in;height:0.71319in\" /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mi>D</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math><br />and <math><mi>D</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/2b873a2a-f13d-4599-ae18-1b0aa3bd6568.png\" style=\"width:5.52708in;height:1.18681in\" /><br />Taking intersection, we get,&nbsp;<math><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Integral values of <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Hence, the sum of values is&nbsp;<math><mo>-</mo><mn>21</mn></math>",
